msgid "GDHCN DEV trust network (WHO)"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:7
msgid "Generic personas"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:79
msgid "Goal: Get every vaccine he needs, once, wherever he is."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:47
msgid "Goal: Give a non-Thai baby proper care, at birth and when he returns."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:71
msgid "Goal: Have Somsack's care recognized at home, without starting over."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:55
msgid "Goal: Keep the whole family's health records in one place he controls."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:87
msgid "Goal: Make sure no newborn in her village is missed, even with no signal."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:63
msgid "Goal: Trust foreign records enough to avoid repeating or missing vaccines."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:22
msgid "Issuer of the birth-dose DVCs (SMART Trust Issuer)"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:67
msgid "Khamla (Mother, Lao PDR)"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:25
msgid "Lao PDR national health portal and gateway (Country B, XXH)"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:64
msgid "Needs: A reliable yes/no on whether a card is genuine; Foreign vaccines translated to the Lao schedule; Automatic calculation of what is due next"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:48
msgid "Needs: A way to issue records that travel with the family; A child's full history at the point of care; Confidence the data is authentic"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:80
msgid "Needs: His birth doses to count at home; No repeated or missed vaccines; His history to be there when a doctor needs it"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:56
msgid "Needs: One app for three people on one phone; Share records abroad without paperwork; Decide who sees what, and for how long"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:72
msgid "Needs: Proof of the vaccines her baby got abroad; Clear guidance on when to come back; Not to be penalized for giving birth across the border"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:88
msgid "Needs: Tools that work offline for weeks; A fast way to capture foreign cards; A clear next step to hand the family"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:14
msgid "Nurse Chanthasone (Vientiane District Health Center, Lao PDR)"
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:85
msgid "Persona for J2: the community health worker of catchment Village 04 in Lao PDR (Country B). Works offline for weeks at a time on an Android phone (OHS app, community configuration) and syncs when she reaches the health center. Can register a child and refer, but cannot decide whether a foreign record is genuine. Fictional."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:61
msgid "Persona for J3: the nurse at Vientiane District Health Center in Lao PDR (Country B), on the clinic's tablet (OHS app, facility configuration). Makes the clinical call when a foreign product has no mapping. Fictional."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:45
msgid "Persona: a Thai clinician in Chiang Rai who gives Somsack's Hep B and BCG birth doses and prints the two signed DVCs (J1), and who sees him again a year later at a primary care clinic, reading his record through the VHL (J4.1). Fictional."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:53
msgid "Persona: Somsack's father, 29, head of the household in Lao PDR, who holds the family's one shared phone (J4). Creates Somsack's passcode-protected VHL (J4.0) and says the passcode aloud at the clinic (J4.1). Fictional."
msgstr ""

#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:69
msgid "Persona: Somsack's mother, 26, a Lao national living in Lao PDR (Country B) who gave birth in Thailand (Country A). Holds the two paper DVCs from J1 to J3. Fictional."
msgstr ""

